{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":70160,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games\",\"tagline\":\"The world will be watching.\",\"overview\":\"In a dystopian society where the Capitol forces each district to send two young tributes to fight to the death in a televised spectacle, a girl volunteers to take her sister’s place, setting the stage for a struggle of survival and defiance.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/apa5G43Hha7kH7wJG0gkkHT7FA9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVYChqJavS1DCXFeJE2lzVUMLKp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":24088,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":142,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":75000000,\"revenue\":694000000,\"director\":\"Gary Ross\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":23964,\"name\":\"Gary Ross\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xIQshBR5eJgzD7RjEXuRwfFvATW.jpg\"},{\"id\":72129,\"name\":\"Jennifer Lawrence\",\"character\":\"Katniss Everdeen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mDKMsjOMytyBiy7MHNZTa7gp7wj.jpg\"},{\"id\":27972,\"name\":\"Josh Hutcherson\",\"character\":\"Peeta Mellark\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ijWdbOzVHg1e0gulVBhfwSKDhZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":96066,\"name\":\"Liam Hemsworth\",\"character\":\"Gale Hawthorne\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7UIm9RoBnlqS1uLlbElAY8urdWD.jpg\"},{\"id\":57755,\"name\":\"Woody Harrelson\",\"character\":\"Haymitch Abernathy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/igxYDQBbTEdAqaJxaW6ffqswmUU.jpg\"},{\"id\":9281,\"name\":\"Elizabeth Banks\",\"character\":\"Effie Trinket\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hQ7IwCQjlpsBPSpnnjjhH3rjwSJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":77069,\"name\":\"Lenny Kravitz\",\"character\":\"Cinna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dUlUZgeCcichbLdnPEfFrD4iy5G.jpg\"},{\"id\":2283,\"name\":\"Stanley Tucci\",\"character\":\"Caesar Flickerman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q4TanMDI5Rgsvw4SfyNbPBh4URr.jpg\"},{\"id\":55636,\"name\":\"Donald Sutherland\",\"character\":\"President Coriolanus Snow\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t9rN5Vni7GYmqqNi9nANCZbmewx.jpg\"},{\"id\":8210,\"name\":\"Wes Bentley\",\"character\":\"Seneca Crane\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/voD93lzFZrr9xfAggwFcPRBi84i.jpg\"},{\"id\":13014,\"name\":\"Toby Jones\",\"character\":\"Claudius Templesmith\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1qNisdp4f1KstdfvAgYXMdrhwfk.jpg\"},{\"id\":23498,\"name\":\"Alexander Ludwig\",\"character\":\"Cato\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3KpzKT4iGhNivSISQMe6EwpAmCi.jpg\"},{\"id\":77517,\"name\":\"Isabelle Fuhrman\",\"character\":\"Clove\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/borthNRiTGa7oKZjLKHuUGUrZdq.jpg\"},{\"id\":561869,\"name\":\"Amandla Stenberg\",\"character\":\"Rue\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r6aPdJnGV2ZZkg6G55WOCicR39f.jpg\"},{\"id\":530025,\"name\":\"Willow Shields\",\"character\":\"Primrose Everdeen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gd4OIdARNyUj2gaecAEZNdHflgM.jpg\"},{\"id\":427,\"name\":\"Sandra Ellis Lafferty\",\"character\":\"Greasy Sae\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tlkmEzWjwaw6i8rBPE71yVJzhw9.jpg\"}],\"franchise\":{\"name\":\"The Hunger Games Collection\",\"parts\":[{\"id\":70160,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games\",\"year\":2012,\"rating\":7.2},{\"id\":101299,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Catching Fire\",\"year\":2013,\"rating\":7.4},{\"id\":131631,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1\",\"year\":2014,\"rating\":6.8},{\"id\":131634,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 2\",\"year\":2015,\"rating\":6.9}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":135397,\"title\":\"Jurassic World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkXjL03yWPmiuFqxWEp4zSYVZBY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF6FjTZzRTENfB4R17HDN20jLT2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12244,\"title\":\"9\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3uqXGOH4BQ2CLJWkDJZ0PzbUzOn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bxgbXWG7dBgNpaFw4BLwzNS7qLk.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 9 first comes to life, he finds himself in a post-apocalyptic world. All humans are gone, and it is only by chance that he discovers a small community of others like him taking refuge from fearsome machines that roam the earth intent on their extinction. Despite being the neophyte of the group, 9 convinces the others that hiding will do them no good.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":294254,\"title\":\"Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mYw7ZyejqSCPFlrT2jHZOESZDU3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4mcOCiR06dqQ5eoEJcG3zvonjOa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thomas and his fellow Gladers face their greatest challenge yet: searching for clues about the mysterious and powerful organization known as WCKD. Their journey takes them to the Scorch, a desolate landscape filled with unimaginable obstacles. Teaming up with resistance fighters, the Gladers take on WCKD’s vastly superior forces and uncover its shocking plans for them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":290859,\"title\":\"Terminator: Dark Fate\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vqzNJRH4YyquRiWxCCOH0aXggHI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a6cDxdwaQIFjSkXf7uskg78ZyTq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Decades after Sarah Connor prevented Judgment Day, a lethal new Terminator is sent to eliminate the future leader of the resistance. In a fight to save mankind, battle-hardened Sarah Connor teams up with an unexpected ally and an enhanced super soldier to stop the deadliest Terminator yet.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44833,\"title\":\"Battleship\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9b0Im7SfedHiajTwzSL9zGyBI7M.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/85PMh0cKywekAJYDnRXfezYAmEc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When mankind beams a radio signal into space, a reply comes from ‘Planet G’, in the form of several alien crafts that splash down in the waters off Hawaii. Lieutenant Alex Hopper is a weapons officer assigned to the USS John Paul Jones, part of an international naval coalition which becomes the world's last hope for survival as they engage the hostile alien force of unimaginable strength. While taking on the invaders, Hopper must also try to live up to the potential that his brother, and his fiancée's father—an Admiral—expect of him.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14869,\"title\":\"G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mc9b25IAprHfsaOz0wTshOwGHcY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jE5wVBRCGQzjHjvFUcYwGS4x0ux.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From the Egyptian desert to deep below the polar ice caps, the elite G.I. JOE team uses the latest in next-generation spy and military equipment to fight the corrupt arms dealer Destro and the growing threat of the mysterious Cobra organization to prevent them from plunging the world into chaos.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":869,\"title\":\"Planet of the Apes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ZWsuP5rExMSji7erxnb1P5SK6F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1HQoPSRZR5CdNPvuSWTvz3aSQQt.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a spectacular crash-landing on an uncharted planet, brash astronaut Leo Davidson finds himself trapped in a savage world where talking apes dominate the human race. Desperate to find a way home, Leo must evade the invincible gorilla army led by Ruthless General Thade.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15767,\"title\":\"Godzilla: Final Wars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/21lWA4YyYppVnwAPOiBkGrt2FGr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/irLLP6uZRB10P4bCGZMzlGB5p6c.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Humanity finally rids themselves of Godzilla, imprisoning him in an icy tomb in the South Pole. All is peaceful until various monsters emerge to lay waste to Earth's cities. Overwhelmed, humanity is seemingly saved by a race of benevolent aliens known as Xiliens. But not all is what it seems with these bizarre visitors. If humanity wishes to survive, they must reluctantly resurrect their most hated enemy, Godzilla.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16320,\"title\":\"Serenity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4sqUOaPFoP2W81mq1UYqZqf5WzA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3aGsZdB5ud6LmU9lppwTLh2fqH1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of rebels travel the outskirts of space evading the sinister Alliance regime. Their lives of smuggling and cargo-running are interrupted by a psychic passenger who harbours a dangerous secret. Soon, the crew find themselves being pursued by an Alliance agent who will stop at nothing to find them.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1196470,\"title\":\"Survive\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7fR3KxswtY8OHHZuOUB9td58CRX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xnLwNvea2TSH0M0oc9iEq2KEVp.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A couple celebrates their son’s birthday in the middle of the ocean on their boat. A violent storm hits and it brings up hungry creatures from the depths and they fight for their survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22080,\"title\":\"Darklight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eG7IlRQyqsE6GAYFVuW6rjlwQlM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/trjFgRm60B8xNclQESWedaGI2DG.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Captured by a secret society known as the Faith and mentally controlled with a powerful spell, ancient demoness Lilith now lives as a young woman with no memory of her agless past. However, the terrifying plague unleashed by a rampaging monster, the Demonicos, forces one human to recruit her mystical power known as the Darklight to fight this terrifying beast...\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1454616,\"title\":\"Blind Ants\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jehMivNmMVciKZNs4XwY9yx3c8W.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/567UptHujPCFl1lvIPtRixirDGa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1935, a storm caused an English ship carrying coal to run aground in Bizkaia. Residents of Algorta gathered to rescue the coal, but Sabas Jauregui ignored their pleas and dragged his children into the storm.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"wLGOaKY5STw\",\"name\":\"Bonus Feature Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"qoUT7q2iTbQ\",\"name\":\"Offiical Trailer #2\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"mfmrPu43DF8\",\"name\":\"Official Theatrical Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\